{"id":"cecb37a89b3604e1","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum.md","title":"惰性化控制负特征值","display":"thm-lazy-walk-spectrum — 惰性化控制负特征值","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum","aliases":["28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum"],"display":"thm-lazy-walk-spectrum — 惰性化控制负特征值","depends_on":["[[28-df-spectral-expander]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.1 after Lemma 21.4 and Theorem 21.9(2) proof; printed pp.425,428,431; PDF pp.451,454,457","source_printed_pages":"425,428,431","source_pdf_pages":"451,454,457","source_status":"supplementary-formalization","proof_status":"local-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lazy-walk-spectrum — 惰性化控制负特征值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.1 after Lemma 21.4 and Theorem 21.9(2) proof; printed pp.425,428,431; PDF pp.451,454,457"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"425,428,431"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"451,454,457"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\ge2\">\\(N\\ge2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ge1\">\\(D\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)\">\\(\\lambda(G)\\)</span>、矩阵、范数与内积见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a> 及其上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(G)\">\\(\\theta(G)\\)</span> 是零和子空间上的最大 Rayleigh 商；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm L}\">\\(R^{\\mathrm L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^{\\mathrm L}\">\\(G^{\\mathrm L}\\)</span> 是下式引入的惰性旋转图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_N\">\\(I_N\\)</span> 为恒等矩阵；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in[N]\">\\(v\\in[N]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[2D]\">\\(i\\in[2D]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(G)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\langle z,P_Gz\\rangle_N:z\\in\\mathbb R^N\\land\\sum_{v=1}^Nz(v)=0\\land\\|z\\|_{2,N}=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(G)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\langle z,P_Gz\\rangle_N:z\\in\\mathbb R^N\\land\\sum_{v=1}^Nz(v)=0\\land\\|z\\|_{2,N}=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm L}(v,i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nR(v,i)&amp;1\\le i\\le D,\\\\\n(v,i)&amp;D&lt;i\\le2D,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad G^{\\mathrm L}\\coloneqq(N,2D,R^{\\mathrm L}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^{\\mathrm L}(v,i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nR(v,i)&amp;1\\le i\\le D,\\\\\n(v,i)&amp;D&lt;i\\le2D,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad G^{\\mathrm L}\\coloneqq(N,2D,R^{\\mathrm L}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G^{\\mathrm L}\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,2D},\\qquad P_{G^{\\mathrm L}}=\\tfrac12(I_N+P_G),\\qquad\\lambda(G^{\\mathrm L})=\\tfrac12(1+\\theta(G))\\le\\tfrac12(1+\\lambda(G)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G^{\\mathrm L}\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,2D},\\qquad P_{G^{\\mathrm L}}=\\tfrac12(I_N+P_G),\\qquad\\lambda(G^{\\mathrm L})=\\tfrac12(1+\\theta(G))\\le\\tfrac12(1+\\lambda(G)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(G)&lt;1\\Longrightarrow\\lambda(G^{\\mathrm L})&lt;1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(G)&lt;1\\Longrightarrow\\lambda(G^{\\mathrm L})&lt;1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书说明自环用于排除二分图的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1\">\\(-1\\)</span> 特征值，并在定理21.9证明末尾分析加自环对特征值的仿射变换。本条采用更清晰的半概率停留版本作为本地完整补充；没有将它冒充原书逐字陈述。</p>\n<p>原端口上的对合和新增端口上的恒等作用互不相交，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm L}\">\\(R^{\\mathrm L}\\)</span> 是对合。新增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 个固定端口使一步以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span> 停留，得到矩阵式。零和单位球在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\ge2\">\\(N\\ge2\\)</span> 时非空且紧，Rayleigh 商连续，所以最大值存在。由实对称矩阵的正交对角化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G\">\\(P_G\\)</span> 的全部特征值在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[-1,1]\">\\([-1,1]\\)</span>，惰性化将它们变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1+\\mu)/2\\in[0,1]\">\\((1+\\mu)/2\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；零和子空间上的最大绝对值因此等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1+\\theta(G))/2\">\\((1+\\theta(G))/2\\)</span>。原参数定义保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(G)\\le\\lambda(G)\">\\(\\theta(G)\\le\\lambda(G)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>连通二分图可以有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)=1\">\\(\\lambda(G)=1\\)</span>，但仍有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(G)&lt;1\">\\(\\theta(G)&lt;1\\)</span>，所以最后一式仍给出惰性游走的严格收缩。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=1\">\\(N=1\\)</span> 被显式排除以避免空单位球的最大值；该情形本身已在谱参数节点处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N\\ge2$，$D\\ge1$，$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$。$\\lambda(G)$、矩阵、范数与内积见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$\\theta(G)$ 是零和子空间上的最大 Rayleigh 商；$R^{\\mathrm L}$、$G^{\\mathrm L}$ 是下式引入的惰性旋转图。$I_N$ 为恒等矩阵；$v\\in[N]$、$i\\in[2D]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"D\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(G)","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm L}","display":false},{"tex":"G^{\\mathrm L}","display":false},{"tex":"I_N","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in[N]","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[2D]","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(G)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\langle z,P_Gz\\rangle_N:z\\in\\mathbb R^N\\land\\sum_{v=1}^Nz(v)=0\\land\\|z\\|_{2,N}=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm L}(v,i)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nR(v,i)&1\\le i\\le D,\\\\\n(v,i)&D<i\\le2D,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad G^{\\mathrm L}\\coloneqq(N,2D,R^{\\mathrm L}).","display":true},{"tex":"G^{\\mathrm L}\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,2D},\\qquad P_{G^{\\mathrm L}}=\\tfrac12(I_N+P_G),\\qquad\\lambda(G^{\\mathrm L})=\\tfrac12(1+\\theta(G))\\le\\tfrac12(1+\\lambda(G)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta(G)<1\\Longrightarrow\\lambda(G^{\\mathrm L})<1.","display":true},{"tex":"-1","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm L}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false},{"tex":"N\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"P_G","display":false},{"tex":"[-1,1]","display":false},{"tex":"(1+\\mu)/2\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"(1+\\theta(G))/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(G)\\le\\lambda(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(G)<1","display":false},{"tex":"N=1","display":false}],"bytes":2431,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-267","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"}],"outgoing":["df14955ee1f08cd3"]}